.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
.Dd October 10, 2026
.Dt DTFL 7
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm dtfl
.Nd timely and differential dataflow for C
.Sh DESCRIPTION
libdtfl is a C11 library for data-parallel dataflow computation.
It ports three Rust projects:
timely dataflow, a runtime for cyclic dataflows with partially ordered
timestamps and progress tracking;
differential dataflow, incrementally maintained collections built on
it; and the timely diagnostics tools.
.Pp
Include
.In dtfl/dtfl.h
and link with
.Fl ldtfl ,
or use
.Ql pkg-config --cflags --libs dtfl .
.Ss Conventions
Fallible functions return 0 or a
.Dv DTFL_E*
code; see
.Xr dtfl_strerror 3 .
Contract violations call the panic hook; see
.Xr dtfl_set_panic_hook 3 .
Every handle has exactly one function that frees or drops it.
.Ss Threads
A worker and every handle derived from it belong to the thread that
runs the worker.
The objects documented as thread-safe in their own pages are the
exceptions.
The library keeps no hidden global state other than the allocation,
panic, log and thread hooks and a per-thread error-detail buffer, and
it never reads the environment.
To embed libdtfl in a host that supplies its own memory, logging and
threads, see
.Xr dtfl_embedding 7 .
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr dtfl_set_alloc_hooks 3 ,
.Xr dtfl_set_log_hook 3 ,
.Xr dtfl_set_sync_hooks 3 ,
.Xr dtfl_set_thread_hooks 3 ,
.Xr dtfl_strerror 3 ,
.Xr dtfl_embedding 7
.Pp
The libdtfl manual, available as
.Ql info libdtfl .
.Sh HISTORY
libdtfl ports timely-dataflow 0.31.0, differential-dataflow 0.25.1 and
the timely diagnostics tools, all by Frank McSherry and contributors and
distributed under the MIT license.
